Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20switch=20to=20GitHub=20Releases=20dete?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ction=20=E2=80=94=20fix=20no-update-found?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

GHCR blob sha256 never matches installed APK sha256 because Android's
PackageInstaller rewrites APKs on install (alignment + verification
metadata). Structural, not fixable in the GHCR approach.

New CommsUpdateWorker: fetches GitHub Releases API latest release,
compares published_at ISO-8601 timestamp against
BuildConfig.COMMS_BUILD_TIMESTAMP baked in at CI time. Public repo —
no auth needed. Downloads APK directly from browser_download_url
(follows S3 redirect). Notifies via system notification; user taps to
open settings and install.

New BuildConfig fields: COMMS_GH_OWNER, COMMS_GH_REPO,
COMMS_RELEASE_ASSET_NAME, COMMS_BUILD_TIMESTAMP (replaces GHCR fields).
All data-driven via build.json::forks.mail.build.gradle_props.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
